{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32","id":5708649036,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVEMSTA","number":32,"title":"清路：写类型只留一处、大模块按职责切开，并把界面测试里的引擎断言先救出来","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:12:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:16:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":9,"total_blocking":9},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n这张不改变任何用户可见行为。它的价值是让后面每一张写路径工单不必先读懂一整块代码，也不让 v1 的结论随界面一起被丢掉。\n\n**1. 写类型只留一处。** 引擎侧的写类型与存储侧的变更类型成员完全重复（四个成员一一对应），于是「新增一种写」要在四个地方各改一次。把它们合成一处，让后面新增写类型只改一个地方。\n\n**2. 大模块按职责切开。** 同步引擎与界面模块都很大，而且里面按工单分段——同一段代码同时承担好几个不相干的变化原因。按职责切开，让后续工单能只读自己那一块。\n\n**3. 先搬后删。** v1 有 521 条测试，其中 203 条随界面重写作废，但这 203 条里混着约 50 条其实是引擎/API 级的断言（同步、写路径、刷新、守卫的结论）。**先把这些断言搬进不依赖界面的测试文件，再让界面重写那张工单去删那 203 个文件。** 不要连结论一起丢掉。\n\n顺带查清日期解析器当前的全部消费者，写进这张工单的收尾说明——v2 整体作废日期解析器，但它现在还被引擎的速记与改期路径用着，界面重写那张工单要照着这份清单删干净。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 新增一种写类型只需要改一个地方，不再四处同步\n- [ ] 引擎与界面的两个大模块按职责切开，没有一段代码同时承担多个不相干的变化原因\n- [ ] 界面测试里那约 50 条引擎/API 级断言已搬进不依赖界面的测试文件，断言的外部行为不变\n- [ ] `uv run pytest` 全绿，测试数量不比搬之前少\n- [ ] 收尾说明里列出日期解析器当前的全部消费者，作为删除时的核对清单\n\n## Blocked by\n\nNone (can start immediately)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/32/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}